# frozen_string_literal: true

REVIEWERS_MESSAGE = <<~MSG
When your merge request is ready, mark it as ready (not a draft) and request a review. It's recommended that you pick the reviewer suggested by the reviewer roulette below, but you can pick someone else if you see fit.

Merge requests should receive a response within the limit documented in the [Review-response SLO](https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/engineering/workflow/code-review/#review-response-slo).

If you don't receive a response from the reviewer within the SLO, please reach out to one of our [project maintainers](https://gitlab-org.gitlab.io/gitlab-roulette/?currentProject=omnibus-gitlab&visible=maintainer%7Cbuild&visible=maintainer%7Cconfigure).
MSG

# Print maintainers message
message(REVIEWERS_MESSAGE)
